{
  "name": "CRYPTO 05 — Daily Portfolio Report (Sheets + Telegram)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 21 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "sched",
      "name": "Every Day at 9 PM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "p1",
              "name": "portfolio",
              "value": "=[\n  { \"symbol\": \"KINS\", \"chain\": \"solana\", \"pair\": \"F42tZnKPavq1VUcrL6ymhc6YqVpt84fWwgzbNTv2wb3W\", \"amount\": 1000000 },\n  { \"symbol\": \"WBNB\", \"chain\": \"bsc\", \"pair\": \"REPLACE_WALLET_CONTOH\", \"amount\": 0.003 }\n]",
              "type": "array"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cfg",
      "name": "My Portfolio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const out = [];\nfor (const p of $json.portfolio) {\n  out.push({ json: { symbol: p.symbol, chain: p.chain, pair: p.pair, amount: p.amount } });\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "split",
      "name": "Split Per Asset",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.dexscreener.com/latest/dex/pairs/{{ $json.chain }}/{{ $json.pair }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "fetch",
      "name": "Fetch Price",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        900,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const pair = $json.pair || $json.pairs?.[0] || {};\nconst symbol = $('Split Per Asset').item.json.symbol;\nconst amount = $('Split Per Asset').item.json.amount;\n\nconst price = parseFloat(pair.priceUsd || 0);\nconst value = price * amount;\nconst chg = parseFloat(pair.priceChange?.h24 || 0);\nconst liq = parseFloat(pair.liquidity?.usd || 0);\nconst vol = parseFloat(pair.volume?.h24 || 0);\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    symbol, amount, price, value,\n    change_24h: chg, liquidity: liq, volume_24h: vol,\n    date: new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10)\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "calc",
      "name": "Calculate Asset Value",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Portfolio",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Tanggal": "={{ $json.date }}",
            "Aset": "={{ $json.symbol }}",
            "Jumlah": "={{ $json.amount }}",
            "Harga": "={{ $json.price }}",
            "Nilai USD": "={{ $json.value }}",
            "Perubahan 24j": "={{ $json.change_24h }}",
            "Likuiditas": "={{ $json.liquidity }}",
            "Volume 24j": "={{ $json.volume_24h }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheets",
      "name": "Log to Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1340,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Merge all assets into one report\nconst items = $input.all();\nlet total = 0;\nlet message = '📈 *DAILY PORTFOLIO REPORT*\\n';\nmessage += 'Date: ' + items[0].json.date + '\\n';\nmessage += '━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\\n\\n';\n\nfor (const it of items) {\n  const j = it.json;\n  total += j.value;\n  const arrow = j.change_24h >= 0 ? '📈' : '📉';\n  message += arrow + ' *' + j.symbol + '*\\n';\n  message += '   Amount: ' + Number(j.amount).toLocaleString('en-US') + '\\n';\n  message += '   Price: $' + Number(j.price).toPrecision(6) + '\\n';\n  message += '   Value: $' + j.value.toFixed(2) + '\\n';\n  message += '   24j: ' + j.change_24h.toFixed(2) + '%\\n\\n';\n}\n\nmessage += '━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\\n';\nmessage += '💰 *TOTAL VALUE: $' + total.toFixed(2) + '*';\n\nreturn [{ json: { report: message, total_value: total } }];"
      },
      "id": "report",
      "name": "Merge Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1560,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "REPLACE_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "={{ $json.report }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "send",
      "name": "Send Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1780,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram Bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CRYPTO 05 — Daily Portfolio Report\n\n**Flow:**\nEvery day at 9 PM → check the price of every asset → log to Sheets → send a Telegram report\n\n**What to edit:**\n- `portfolio` in the *My Portfolio* node — your asset list and amounts\n- `GANTI_SPREADSHEET_ID` — your Google Sheet ID\n\n**The sheet needs a *Portfolio* tab with these headers:**\nTanggal, Asset, Jumlah, Harga, Nilai USD, Perubahan 24j, Likuiditas, Volume 24j\n\n**Result:**\n- A daily history of portfolio value (ready for charting)\n- A Telegram report every evening\n\n**Good for:**\n- Investors who want routine tracking\n- Airdrop farmers (monitor holding value)\n- Anyone who needs clean records",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "note",
      "name": "Panduan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every Day at 9 PM": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "My Portfolio",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "My Portfolio": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Split Per Asset",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Split Per Asset": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch Price",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch Price": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Calculate Asset Value",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Calculate Asset Value": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log to Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Log to Sheets": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Merge Report",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Merge Report": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Report",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "staticData": null,
  "pinData": {}
}